WEBVTT

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:04.130
As I just explained,
the purpose ofthis operation...

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:09.610
is to collect all physical data,
including her ability to transform.

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:13.780
Merely collecting more data on her
seems like a halfway measure.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.330
Is that so?

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.490
You can't fight without
knowing your enemy.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.650
Our past failures
are a case in point.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.170
Precisely.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.880
Furthermore, I will join this
operation, to observe first-hand.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.480
Commander, that's too risky!

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.800
You might come into
contact with the target.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.360
I want to observe her myself.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.560
Besides, executive commanders
who always remain in safe places...

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.730
garner no respect.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:47.630
Understood.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.980
Then, you intend to collect
the data yourself?

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:56.010
I'll be accompanied by someone who
has already been studying the target.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:03.410
Yes.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.830
Yes, the target's
research is proceeding.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.720
I think I can give you
a report very soon.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.050
Oh, really!?

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.050
Yes, l'll be right there.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.520
I can collect data firsthand.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.710
Start decorating the summer night sky.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:56.800
Diamonds started twinkling in a galaxy.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.680
I threw myself in a time and wandered.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:09.020
The smile made me warm up after a hard journey.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:21.660
You pretended like you didn't know that.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:27.000
If it's an endless dream...

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:33.670
I'll fight to make it shine.

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:45.680
I'll expect again and again to realize...

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:53.770
I'm only looking at my precious future.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:33.670
We are a private enterprise but currently
working for another government as a consignor.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:37.900
We are here, because we've encountered a situation that we can't handle by ourselves.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.780
Oh, I see.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:51.290
Super activation materials encased in variably structured ceramics and magnetically sealed.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.980
We call it Matoryoshika.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:54.710
I see.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:59.690
During the great land submergence,
our institution sank.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.830
Since that time,
Matoryoshika has been lost.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.050
The map we had before
was completely useless.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:09.180
We've investigated several times,
but our operators couldn't find it.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:14.060
So we would like to get the famous
special A-Rank salvager...

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.130
Ms. Aika Sumeragi's help.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.150
W...well.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:27.580
We'll soon arrive at the remains
of our Air Force base.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.540
Wow!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.700
It's all white.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.210
The base preparations?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.120
Completed.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.000
OK.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.750
Landing altitude determined.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.920
Landing.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.600
Welcome to our base.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.840
I'm Etusko Mina,
l'm the head ofthis base.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.230
I'm Aika Sumeragi.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:00.590
We were awaiting your arrival.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.190
Mr. President and Ms. Vice president,
thank you for bringing her.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.400
Did anything happen
while I was gone?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.940
No, everything is
proceeding smoothly.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.490
Good.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.920
This is a very extensive base.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.960
I understand why you wanted
an aerial investigation.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.380
That's the probe plane
I want you to use.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.370
We remodeled a military spy plane...

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.600
and built-in some high
performance probe equipment.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:42.370
Wow, that's big.

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:55.300
She is just a kid, Aika.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.960
Yes, she is very young.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.340
I'm Rie Betriacoff.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.800
I'm Aika Sumeragi,
nice too meet you.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.760
I've heard a lot about you.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.140
Oh, you must've heard bad things.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.470
You're operating a
very powerful plane.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.030
It's maximum speed is mach 3.2.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.340
There's built-in high performance
probe equipment.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.480
You can probe a wide range of
areas in a short amount of time.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.780
One more thing, Miss. Aika,
we want you to take...

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.440
a physical and functional examination
before you operate this plane.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.840
Oh?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.920
You need adaptability to
operate this plane.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.370
It's a very simple exam.
It won't take long.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.120
Examination...all right.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.040
Rie, l'll let you take care of this.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.300
Yes.

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:43.500
Everybody else, please come with me.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.610
Well, 5 cm.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:52.960
Your body is not very
flexible, Miss. Aika.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.060
Isn't it?

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.350
Look at me!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.900
Here we go.
See, 14 cm.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:03.060
I see...l see.
Let's move on to the next test!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.320
Left hand on number 35.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.230
OK.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.860
Right foot on number 2.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.240
Here we go!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:10.390
Hey!

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:13.700
Is there a relationship between
doing these poses and flying a plane?

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.060
There is.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:15.580
Next!

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.790
I'm sure that girl is doing
weird things to Aika.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.250
I'm going to peep inside.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.590
Quietly... quietly.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.210
Don't peep inside!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.850
All right. Good work.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:42.750
Ah, l'm so tired.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.820
Well, let's move on!

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:45.920
What?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.320
Do I have to do more?

00:07:58.100 --> 00:07:59.660
Hey, Papa!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.030
That girl, Rie, must be doing
weird things to Aika.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:03.960
What?

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:09.090
That's why she won't let me in.
Something's weird!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.230
I don't think so.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.560
Hey!
Why don't you work?

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.160
Can't you slow it down a little?

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.380
Next! 9G's!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.170
Oh, no!

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:42.390
Next! 11G's!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.850
Wait a minute!

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:52.320
Take off her clothes and place
her on the operating table!

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:53.380
Yes.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:58.070
Now we will start the real
examination, Miss Aika.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:02.480
I will explore your secrets.

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.190
Let me show you
your accommodations.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.650
Alright.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:13.250
Excuse me, is Miss Sumeragi's
examination done yet?

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.660
I think it will take
a little more time.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:22.870
What?

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.800
Hey!

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.320
What's this?
What is this thing?

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:33.000
Hey, hey, hey!
What is this?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.530
Please stop it.
What are you doing?
Hey, hey, hey!
What is this?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.950
Please stop!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.210
What's this, eh?

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.140
Tell me! What's this?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.540
Please don't do that!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.800
Well? Well? Answer me!
Why don't you?

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.010
No! No!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.460
Hey! Hey!

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.880
Ouch!

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:18.820
I knew it!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:20.870
I thought something was wrong.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.950
This was all a Delmos trick.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.180
I have to tell Aika.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.520
Hey, Michikusa!

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.130
Do I look good?

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:43.560
Commander! We're collecting
satisfactory data from the target.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.270
Good.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:47.370
Therefore, you can leave
all the remaining work to us.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.440
Are you telling me to go back
to headquarters?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:55.280
How can an Executive Commander
leave in the middle of the operation?

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:56.300
But...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.130
Why don't you sit down?

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.100
Would you like some tea?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.690
Well...

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:11.020
Oh, did you wake up?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:15.230
I'm sorry.
I went a little too far.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.610
Well, are you trying to kill me?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.440
So, can you tell us
more about yourself?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.210
I want to hear more, too!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.100
Please tell us!

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.670
Well, I can't tell you
any interesting stories.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.440
Here, drink more.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:37.200
Oh, l've already had enough.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:40.400
Don't say that.
Please have some.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.030
Are you?

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.110
What's wrong, Mr. Aida?

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.180
Is anything wrong?

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.560
I don't want to seem rude...

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:56.090
but it seems like l've met
all of you once before.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.650
Oh, no!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.620
Why don't you sing a song?

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.760
We have karaoke in this room.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.540
What?! Oh, really?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:10.330
Well, why not?
Just one song.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.650
You can sing as many
songs as you want.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:17.120
Then, why don't you join me?

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.060
Is this switch on?

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.680
How's that?

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:31.640
That multi-axis trainer wore me out.
I'm still feeling chest pains.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:34.910
You were very sexy when
you were unconscious.

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.940
Don't laugh!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.180
Well then...

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:44.070
She is really a weird girl.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:48.060
Miss Aika, what do
you want to drink?

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.730
Do you have beer?

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.700
Oh, l'm sorry, we don't
have any alcohol here.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.920
Then, l'll take coffee.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.420
All right!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.000
Aika!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:58.960
Rion!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.630
What's Michikusa doing here, too?!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.870
Oh, great!
You're all right!

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.550
What do you mean
l'm all right?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.250
Aika! This place isn't a
private enterprise facility.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:11.600
This is a Delmo base!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.380
This girl, Rie, must be a Delmo too!

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:16.260
I'm sure of it!

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:18.610
We have to leave
here right now, Aika!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.220
Yes, I think we have to leave.

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:22.740
That's right.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:28.700
You finally found out the truth.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.890
I knew it.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:42.630
That costume!
Rie, you're a...

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.950
Yes, Miss. Aika!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:50.220
Golden Delmo, Rie!
That's my real name.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.620
You found out the truth very quickly.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:54.980
But it's all right.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:14:00.020
Therefore our story about asking your
help to investigate Matoryoshika...

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:04.700
and other things, including this
examination to operate the plane...

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.410
and of course,
everything else was all...

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.570
a lie!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.440
You were so easilyfooled.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.890
You look so innocent and
cute for an older woman.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:24.630
If it's a lie, then there must be
a real purpose behind this.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.340
Bingo! That's right.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.720
The thing we really
wanted to get was...

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.570
Ta-daaa!
The data on Miss Aika!

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:38.800
Fortunately, I got
a full load of your data.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:39.850
Everything from head to toe.

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.820
Now, the last thing I have to
take is your fighting data.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:44.530
Here we go!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.990
Ready?

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.150
Action!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:13.350
This is great!
Watching this live is much better.

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.040
Aika, you were great!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.040
Oh, she's escaped.

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.580
Bye bye!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.250
Hey!

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:45.090
Wait up!

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.380
Aika! Your clothes!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.760
Well, well, what's next?

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.100
Huh?

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:57.930
Why are you disturbing me
when l'm having fun?

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.410
Do it!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.520
Here they come.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:15.660
Once you decided to do as a man

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.030
Even if people laugh at you

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:30.170
I'll live my life only one way

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.880
You can't escape anymore.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.300
I wasn't trying to escape.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.260
What did you say?

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.550
I've something
interesting to show you.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.920
Aika, it's you!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.310
What is this?

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:45.650
I checked every
part of your body.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:50.790
Oh, she's naked.

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:54.490
Michikusa, you don't
have to see this.

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:58.160
I'll check inside her body next.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:01.560
Inside my body?

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.300
Anesthesia!

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:15.440
As you see, l've gotten
all the data from you.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:23.020
Why did you do such a thing?

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:25.770
We want to study your strength...

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.980
and use it to make our
"Delmogeny" even stronger.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:31.440
I'll never let you do that!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.210
I've already studied
the way you fight.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.480
Aika!

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:56.380
Sorry, that's useless.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:11.190
Now, I have to find my data.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.050
Aika!

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.920
There's a sign saying "Data Room".

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.960
I guess this is it!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:34.920
Bingo!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:42.060
She does make a fast getaway.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:44.070
Now, l'm very mad!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:47.410
Rion! Go find the President
and prepare to escape!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.090
About 40 steps...

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:56.840
Considering Rion's physique,
she's about 40 meters ahead.

00:18:57.850 --> 00:19:00.780
We have to call them
when we find the target.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:04.010
I hope she doesn't come this way.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.120
W...what is it?

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.000
The target is approaching.
We will hold her off, here.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.060
That's not fair!

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.560
I've got a headache.

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.810
Papa!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.040
Papa!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.490
Oh, Rion!

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:57.050
Michikusa, what the
hell are you wearing?!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.980
Terrible danger! Terrible!

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.380
You smell like alcohol!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.950
How could you drink at
a time like this?!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.160
I don't believe you!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.500
Well, it's not so simple to explain.

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:09.120
There's no time to talk about it.
This is an emergency!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.690
The base is...

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.450
I know. The Delmos tricked us.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.320
They just attacked me.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:15.980
What?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.900
What happened to Aika?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.030
She told me to prepare to escape
and wait for her.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.530
All right. Let's go!

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:24.990
Blue Streak! Come in!
Blue Streak! Come in!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.740
Blue Streak! Come in!

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.950
This is Red Top!
Blue Streak! Come in!

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:31.870
Nobody is responding.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:33.520
I see.

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:38.940
Rie, what's wrong?

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:42.630
I've got the data, however...

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.160
Excellent work, Rie.

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:48.180
We will take care of it from here.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.640
Uh... yes.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:54.040
Are you planning to fight?

00:20:57.380 --> 00:20:59.330
I'll go along with you.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:07.700
She's coming.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:10.540
Ready?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.370
Yes.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.920
You were all Delmos!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.090
Couldn't you tell?

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.760
I won't give the data back.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.720
Hargen is gone, now.
Why must you continue this?!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:31.250
Yes, Mr. Hargen is gone.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:36.840
And perhaps we don't need to exist anymore, since
the Delmos were created to serve Mr. Hargen.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:40.590
But we still have pride.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.200
Aika Sumeragi!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:45.710
We will defeat you and
show our loyalty to Mr. Hargen!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.450
That is our will!

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:34.200
N... No!

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.500
No!

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:46.520
N... No!

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:50.080
C-Commander!

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:42.360
Idiot!

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:00.330
Tight.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.700
Rion, it's a little
tight, but be patient.

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:04.290
Yes.

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:17.520
I will not let you escape!

00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:19.330
Max power!

00:24:28.720 --> 00:24:29.440
Rie.

00:24:37.940 --> 00:24:39.620
Stop it, Rie!

00:27:11.260 --> 00:27:16.070
Aika and the K2 Corporation
are destroyed mercilessly...

00:27:16.070 --> 00:27:18.570
by the Golden Delmo's fierce attack.

00:27:18.570 --> 00:27:22.580
Aika!

00:27:22.580 --> 00:27:23.660
Calm down, Rion!

00:27:23.910 --> 00:27:28.360
Papa, papa don't you feel anything?
We've lost Aika, and our company.

00:27:28.360 --> 00:27:29.540
Don't say such stupid things!

00:27:29.540 --> 00:27:30.630
I won't forgive them!

00:27:30.630 --> 00:27:32.380
I'll never forgive them!

00:27:32.380 --> 00:27:34.570
I'll get revenge for Aika!

00:27:34.570 --> 00:27:35.550
Let's go Michikusa!

00:27:36.280 --> 00:27:38.290
We'll have a battle to avenge Aika!

00:27:38.290 --> 00:27:39.950
Rion, wait!

00:27:39.950 --> 00:27:41.590
Don't be a fool!
Don't be so hasty!

00:27:42.710 --> 00:27:47.040
Rion breaks into the Delmo base
with Gusto and Maypia.

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:49.770
No!!

00:27:50.300 --> 00:27:52.310
Aika, next trial!

00:27:52.310 --> 00:27:52.700
Break the Decisive Battle! Delmo Base!!

00:27:52.700 --> 00:27:55.480
Break the decisive battle!
Delmo base!

00:27:55.480 --> 00:27:55.890
Break the Decisive Battle! Delmo Base!!

00:27:55.890 --> 00:27:59.420
A blue flower whirls
in jet-black darkness.

00:27:59.420 --> 00:28:04.120
Break the Decisive Battle! Delmo Base!!
